herdl-product-namespace

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Give HerDL independent product identity, mutable-state roots, runtime paths, routing environment, and operator command text.
Upstream-Status: inappropriate: downstream HerDL product namespace
Drop-When: The HerDL downstream product is retired.
